o":"秦","resolved_place_entity_id":18,"start_index":97,"tongjian_id":"8c6822c7-db0e-11ef-a358-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"丹阳、蓝田之战","tongjian_id":"war_N0516"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"容斋随笔/战国自取亡","excerpts":[{"context_after":"，不能取偿，身遭囚辱以死。赵以上党之地，代韩受兵，利令智...","context_before":"...孙沮气，孑孑自保，终堕秦计，束手为虏。怀王贪商於六百里，","source_end_index":303,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"1509ccdd-dd12-435e-a66e-d1a5b3e173e1","source_start_index":289,"source_text":"受诈张仪，失其名都，丧其甲士"}],"path":"随笔/卷十/战国自取亡","source_name":"容斋随笔"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"又秦昭襄十六年，司马错取邓，封公子悝于邓，此邓城也]。","context_before":"...年，蔡侯、郑伯会于邓。又昭十三年，楚蔡公子干子鹔盟于邓。","source_end_index":79,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"f3cb31fd-7162-5d9f-a01d-4363e5d7a7b1","source_start_index":52,"source_text":"战国时，楚怀王伐秦，败于蓝田。韩、魏闻之，南袭楚至邓。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/八、南阳府（卷五十一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"]。","context_before":"...关，又东南流经丹水故城，又东南而合于淅水，下流入于均水。","source_end_index":107,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"9d405267-107b-546a-8def-2f83f36c5cfb","source_start_index":77,"source_text":"战国赧王三年，秦人大败楚师于丹阳，遂取汉中郡。盖即丹水之阳矣"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/八、南阳府（卷五十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、西安府（卷五十三）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"又沛公与秦军战于蓝田南，败之。汉建安十七年，马超余众屯蓝...","context_before":"...书》：梁惠成王三年，秦子向命为蓝君。盖向之故邑，后置县。","source_end_index":79,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"b1a94414-3a3e-5734-ac4d-159cabbd469d","source_start_index":49,"source_text":"周赧王三年，楚怀王因丹阳之败，悉国兵复袭秦，战于蓝田，大败。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/一、西安府（卷五十三）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事","外交"],"content":"1春，秦師及楚戰于丹陽，楚師大敗，斬甲士八萬，虜屈匄及列侯、執珪七十餘人，遂取漢中郡。楚王悉發國內兵以復襲秦，戰於藍田，楚師大敗。韓、魏聞楚之困，南襲楚，至鄧。楚人聞之，乃引兵歸，割兩城以請平于秦。","content_fanyi":"春季，秦、楚两国军队在丹阳交战，楚军大败，秦军斩杀甲士八万人，俘虏了将军屈匄以及列侯、执珪等有爵位者七十余人，随后夺取汉中郡。楚王征发国内全部兵力再次袭击秦国，双方在蓝田交战，楚军又大败。韩、魏两国听说楚国陷入困境，便向南袭击楚国，到达邓县。楚军听到这个消息，便撤军回国，割让两座城邑向秦国求和。","content_jianti_auto":"1春，秦师及楚战于丹阳，楚师大败，斩甲士八万，虏屈匄及列侯、执珪七十余人，遂取汉中郡。楚王悉发国内兵以复袭秦，战于蓝田，楚师大败。韩、魏闻楚之困，南袭楚，至邓。楚人闻之，乃引兵归，割两城以请平于秦。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":246,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf4f-db0e-11ef-b693-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"燕國","place_name_jianti_auto":"燕国","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c6822cf-db0e-11ef-a899-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8c6822d0-db0e-11ef-a9d6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c6822cc-db0e-11ef-acf6-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"8c6822cd-db0e-11ef-986a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"張","people_name_jianti_auto":"张","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"8c6822ce-db0e-11ef-b549-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：十二行本「後」下有「卽位」二字；乙十一行本同；孔本同；張校同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：十二行本「后」下有「即位」二字；乙十一行本同；孔本同；张校同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c6822cb-db0e-11ef-a651-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"言燕國爲齊所破，己承其後也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"言燕国为齐所破，己承其后也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"8c6822ca-db0e-11ef-b379-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"臧文仲","people_name_jianti_auto":"臧文仲","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c6822d2-db0e-11ef-90d5-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"杜預","people_name_jianti_auto":"杜预","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"8c6822d3-db0e-11ef-96d3-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"郭","people_name_jianti_auto":"郭","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"8c6822d4-db0e-11ef-9aa0-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"虢公","people_name_jianti_auto":"虢公","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"8c6822d5-db0e-11ef-b934-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"虢公","people_name_jianti_auto":"虢公","start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"8c6822d6-db0e-11ef-849b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"郭公","people_name_jianti_auto":"郭公","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"8c6822d7-db0e-11ef-93fe-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"周","place_name_jianti_auto":"周","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"8c6822d8-db0e-11ef-b3ff-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"臧文仲曰：列國有凶稱孤，禮也。杜預曰：列國諸侯無凶則稱寡人。郭姓出於周之虢公，世亦謂虢公爲郭公。隗，五罪翻。少，始紹翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"臧文仲曰：列国有凶称孤，礼也。杜预曰：列国诸侯无凶则称寡人。郭姓出于周之虢公，世亦谓虢公为郭公。隗，五罪翻。少，始绍翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":68,"tongjian_id":"8c6822d1-db0e-11ef-adf3-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"燕王噲","people_name_jianti_auto":"燕王哙","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c6822da-db0e-11ef-8c63-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"謂燕王噲破國之恥。噲，苦夬翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"谓燕王哙破国之耻。哙，苦夬翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":89,"tongjian_id":"8c6822d9-db0e-11ef-880c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"8c6822dc-db0e-11ef-98ed-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"應劭","people_name_jianti_auto":"应劭","start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"8c6822dd-db0e-11ef-a6ee-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"春秋","place_name_jianti_auto":"春秋","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c6822de-db0e-11ef-ae41-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"8c6822df-db0e-11ef-a581-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"8c6822e0-db0e-11ef-aa03-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"春秋以來，諸侯之國有涓人，秦、漢之間有中涓。師古曰：涓，潔也。言其在中主知潔清灑掃之事，蓋王之親舊左右也。應劭曰：涓人如謁者。涓，古玄翻。灑，所賣翻；掃，所報翻；又皆音如字。","note_content_jianti_auto":"春秋以来，诸侯之国有涓人，秦、汉之间有中涓。师古曰：涓，洁也。言其在中主知洁清洒扫之事，盖王之亲旧左右也。应劭曰：涓人如谒者。涓，古玄翻。洒，所卖翻；扫，所报翻；又皆音如字。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":128,"tongjian_id":"8c6822db-db0e-11ef-8708-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"燕王","people_name_jianti_auto":"燕王","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c6822e3-db0e-11ef-a7db-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"郭隗","people_name_jianti_auto":"郭隗","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8c6822e4-db0e-11ef-a5e5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"言燕王若加禮於郭隗，則四方之賢士聞之，將不以千里爲遠而來。","note_content_jianti_auto":"言燕王若加礼于郭隗，则四方之贤士闻之，将不以千里为远而来。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":204,"tongjian_id":"8c6822e2-db0e-11ef-9039-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"劇","people_name_jianti_auto":"剧","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8c6822e7-db0e-11ef-abb2-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"辛","people_name_jianti_auto":"辛","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"8c6822e8-db0e-11ef-8c5b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"劇","people_name_jianti_auto":"剧","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"8c6822e9-db0e-11ef-b5b5-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"班","people_name_jianti_auto":"班","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"8c6822ea-db0e-11ef-b3b1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_n